18, and children under 3 ride for free. School students and passengers with a disability can ride for $1.00. People ages 60 and up can ride for free. If you would like to travel to Beaver Island from downtown Charlevoix with the Beaver Island Boat Company, please go to bibco.com for the seasonal ferry schedule.","pickupMessage":"{\"prior_notice_duration_min\": 90}","dropOffMessage":null,"phoneNumber":"(231) 582-6900","infoUrl":"https://ccttransit.routematch.com/customer/","bookingUrl":null},{"id":"CC_booking_rule_CC2","bookingType":1,"priorNoticeDurationMin":90,"priorNoticeDurationMax":null,"priorNoticeLastDay":null,"priorNoticeLastTime":null,"priorNoticeStartDay":null,"priorNoticeStartTime":null,"priorNoticeCalendarId":null,"message":"The Charlevoix County Medical Trips service provides service for out of county Medical Trips to all county residents to Petoskey and Gaylord.  The fare for round trips is $10.00, and $5.00 extra each way for out-of-county.  Residents 60 and up, and veterans with VA Approved Medical Appointments can ride for free.","pickupMessage":"{\"prior_notice_duration_min\": 90}","dropOffMessage":null,"phoneNumber":"(231) 582-6900","infoUrl":"https://ccttransit.routematch.com/customer/","bookingUrl":null},{"id":"CC_booking_rule_CC2_char","bookingType":1,"priorNoticeDurationMin":90,"priorNoticeDurationMax":null,"priorNoticeLastDay":null,"priorNoticeLastTime":null,"priorNoticeStartDay":null,"priorNoticeStartTime":null,"priorNoticeCalendarId":null,"message":"The Charlevoix County Medical Trips service provides service for out of county Medical Trips to all county residents to Petoskey and Gaylord.  The fare for round trips is $10.00, and $5.00 extra each way for out-of-county.  Residents 60 and up, and veterans with VA Approved Medical Appointments can ride for free. If you would like to travel to Beaver Island from downtown Charlevoix with the Beaver Island Boat Company, please go to bibco.com for the seasonal ferry schedule.","pickupMessage":"{\"prior_notice_duration_min\": 90}","dropOffMessage":null,"phoneNumber":"(231) 582-6900","infoUrl":"https://ccttransit.routematch.com/customer/","bookingUrl":null},{"id":"CC_booking_rule_CC3","bookingType":0,"priorNoticeDurationMin":null,"priorNoticeDurationMax":null,"priorNoticeLastDay":null,"priorNoticeLastTime":null,"priorNoticeStartDay":null,"priorNoticeStartTime":null,"priorNoticeCalendarId":null,"message":"The Ironton Ferry operates seasonally from mid-April through mid-November. A single ride fare is $5.00, a book of 20 passes costs $50.00, and an unlimited monthly pass costs $75.00. Non-motorized vehicles (like bicycles) ride for $1.00, and pedestrians ride for free. ","pickupMessage":null,"dropOffMessage":null,"phoneNumber":"(231) 547-7244","infoUrl":"https://ccttransit.routematch.com/customer/","bookingUrl":null},{"id":"CC_booking_rule_CC4","bookingType":0,"priorNoticeDurationMin":90,"priorNoticeDurationMax":null,"priorNoticeLastDay":null,"priorNoticeLastTime":null,"priorNoticeStartDay":null,"priorNoticeStartTime":null,"priorNoticeCalendarId":null,"message":"The Charlevoix County Transit Demand-Response Service operates on Beaver Island and it can accommodate same-day service. To coordinate travel on Beaver Island, please first consult the Beaver Island Ferry schedule to coordinate travel to the island. Riders can book immediate service with the Charlevoix County Transit Demand-Response Service, but one hour prior notice is recommended to best acccommodate requests. The fare for adults age 19 to 59 is $2.00, $1.50 for youth ages 3-18, and children under 3 ride for free. School students and passengers with a disability can ride for $1.00. People ages 60 and up can ride for free.","pickupMessage":"{\"prior_notice_duration_min\": \"90\"}","dropOffMessage":null,"phoneNumber":null,"infoUrl":null,"bookingUrl":null}],"calendars":[{"id":"CC_mon-tues-wed-thurs-fri","days":["mon","tue","wed","thu","fri"],"startDate":"2024-01-01","endDate":"2027-12-31","exceptedDates":["